31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone, listen! I'm the Seer, and I checked Shion. He's the werewolf!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That was fast. You're either telling the truth, or you're a very bold werewolf trying to frame me.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"A claim on day one is aggressive. Kenji, are you certain?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Servas,,A bold revelation. Let us consider the possibilities carefully.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Yumi,,What?! Shion is the werewolf? I can't believe it!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm 100% sure! Please, we have to vote for him now!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, if you're the werewolf, you've just put a huge target on your back for tomorrow.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"If Shion is the werewolf, the Possessed will likely try to defend him.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, you seem quite shocked. Is it genuine surprise or something more?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm just surprised! I really thought Shion was a good guy!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,See? Shion is just trying to confuse us with logic!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Logic isn't a crime. @Ryuji, you're the most rational here. Doesn't this feel too convenient?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"It is convenient, but the Seer's role is to provide this exact information.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,The weight of evidence currently leans toward the young Kenji's claim.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I don't want to vote for Shion if he's innocent... but Kenji sounds so sure!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Please, trust me! Let's get the werewolf out now!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Very well. If you wish to follow a child's intuition over reason, be my guest.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'll trust the Seer for now.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,I agree. It is the most logical path forward.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Okay... I'll vote with everyone else.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
